# The repository never ships API credentials. Configure the provider supported
# by your Hermes Agent installation, then copy only the variables you need into
# a local .env file. Never commit that file.
#
# Example placeholders (names may differ by Hermes/provider version):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=replace-me
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://example.invalid/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=replace-me
